---
import DocsSwitcher from "../../components/DocsSwitcher.astro";
import DocsTabs from "../../components/DocsTabs.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Psi Tutorial | Productive Superintelligence" layout="docs">
    <DocsSwitcher current="psi" />
    <DocsTabs current="tutorial" />

    <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="tutorial-title">
        <p class="label">Tutorial</p>
        <h1 id="tutorial-title">Install, inspect, launch.</h1>
        <hr />
        <p class="section-copy">
            PsiCLI prepares local credentials and launches package resources.
            PsiHub validates, stores, downloads, and renders package metadata.
        </p>

        <div class="page-list">
            <div>
                <span class="item-title">1. Install The Local Tools</span>
                <span class="item-copy">Install the command line, package hub, and framework packages together for local PSI work.</span>
                <pre><code>python -m pip install prosi-psi-cli psihub lllm-core sssn aaax</code></pre>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="item-title">2. Validate A Package</span>
                <span class="item-copy">Use PsiHub from Python when package metadata checks belong inside scripts or apps.</span>
                <pre><code>from psihub import validate_package

report = validate_package("packages/analyst-tactics")
assert report.ok</code></pre>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="item-title">3. Prepare Credentials</span>
                <span class="item-copy">Use PsiCLI before launching packages that declare provider keys.</span>
                <pre><code>psi init packages/analyst-tactics
psi inspect packages/analyst-tactics --json</code></pre>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="item-title">4. Launch Locally</span>
                <span class="item-copy">Launch the package's primary resource as a local FastAPI service.</span>
                <pre><code>psi launch packages/analyst-tactics --port 8000</code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</SiteLayout>
